# game/ch07.rpy:12
translate english ch7_4f737d8c:

    # n "周日中午，阿狐的游戏账号好不容易练到了高级段位，皮肤和道具攒了一大堆。"
    n "Sunday noon. Ahu had finally leveled his game account to a high rank, with a pile of skins and items collected."

# game/ch07.rpy:13
translate english ch7_658c832c:

    # n "游戏交流群里，一条消息弹了出来。"
    n "In the game chat group, a message popped up."

# game/ch07.rpy:14
translate english ch7_2efd8d4a:

    # fraud laugh "高价收游戏账号！高级号500元起收，租号每月150元！走「官方担保平台」，安全无忧，童叟无欺！"
    fraud laugh "Buying game accounts at high prices! High-rank accounts from 500 yuan, rentals 150 yuan a month! Through our \"official escrow platform\" — safe and fair!"

# game/ch07.rpy:15
translate english ch7_5cc281f7:

    # think laugh "我的账号能卖500？那新游戏机不就有盼头了！"
    think laugh "My account could sell for 500? Maybe that new console isn't out of reach!"

# game/ch07.rpy:18
translate english ch7_23d4968d:

    # fraud laugh "有意向加我，发账号评估价格，三分钟出结果！"
    fraud laugh "Interested? Add me, send your account for appraisal — results in three minutes!"

# game/ch07.rpy:32
translate english ch7_A_99b25bfa:

    # n "阿狐盯着「500元收号」的消息，心里犯起了嘀咕。"
    n "Ahu eyed the \"500 yuan for your account\" message, feeling uneasy."

# game/ch07.rpy:33
translate english ch7_A_81969033:

    # think serious "账号是我练了好几年的心血，也是爸爸妈妈花钱养的。老师说，虚拟财产同样重要，不能交给陌生人！"
    think serious "This account is years of my effort and Mom and Dad's money. Teacher said virtual property matters too — never hand it to strangers!"

# game/ch07.rpy:34
translate english ch7_A_3b4a16be:

    # mc serious "租号卖号风险太大了，账号被盗、被拿去干坏事，责任都是我的。我不卖！"
    mc serious "Renting or selling is too risky — if the account gets stolen or used for crimes, it's on me. I'm not selling!"

# game/ch07.rpy:35
translate english ch7_A_0ffbd5dd:

    # n "阿狐退出了群聊，还截图举报了这条收号广告。"
    n "Ahu left the group and screenshot-reported the buying ad."

# game/ch07.rpy:38
translate english ch7_A_0bafcc73:

    # police laugh "好样的！游戏账号绑着手机号、支付方式，卖号租号等于把「家门钥匙」交给别人。骗子还常用租来的账号实施诈骗、洗钱，账号主人也要担责任！"
    police laugh "Great call! Game accounts are tied to phone numbers and payment methods — selling or renting one is like handing your house keys to a stranger. Scammers often use rented accounts for fraud and money laundering, and the original owner shares the blame!"

# game/ch07.rpy:50
translate english ch7_B_a452b903:

    # mc confused "担保平台交易，具体是怎么个担保法呀？"
    mc confused "Escrow platform, huh? How does the escrow actually work?"

# game/ch07.rpy:51
translate english ch7_B_2e455c5a:

    # fraud laugh "很简单！点击我发的「平台链接」，把账号密码填进去评估，平台显示价格后你确认出售，钱立刻到账，平台全程担保！"
    fraud laugh "Simple! Click the \"platform link\" I send, fill in your account and password for appraisal, confirm the sale once the price shows, and the money lands instantly. The platform guarantees everything!"

# game/ch07.rpy:52
translate english ch7_B_1bed8824:

    # n "对方发来一个和正规交易平台长得几乎一样的链接。"
    n "The scammer sent a link that looked almost identical to the real trading platform."

# game/ch07.rpy:53
translate english ch7_B_1239c60e:

    # fraud serious "评估要趁早，高价号源马上满了，晚一步价格就掉啦！"
    fraud serious "Appraise early! Slots for high-price accounts are filling up — wait one second and the price drops!"

# game/ch07.rpy:67
translate english ch7_B1_3615a920:

    # n "阿狐关掉对话，拿着手机找到爸爸。"
    n "Ahu closed the chat and went to find Dad."

# game/ch07.rpy:68
translate english ch7_B1_8615a44b:

    # think worried "平台看起来挺正规的，可「填账号密码」这一步，总觉得不太对劲。"
    think worried "The platform looks legit, but the \"fill in your password\" step feels off."

# game/ch07.rpy:69
translate english ch7_B1_e56e1dcd:

    # mc worried "爸爸，有人说我的游戏账号值500元，让我在链接里填账号密码评估，是真的吗？"
    mc worried "Dad, someone says my game account is worth 500 yuan and wants me to fill in my account and password on a link to appraise it. Is that real?"

# game/ch07.rpy:70
translate english ch7_B1_57313141:

    # dad serious "儿子，这是「收号」骗局！你看这个链接，域名和官方平台差了两个字母，是高仿钓鱼网站。账号密码一填，号瞬间就被盗走。"
    dad serious "Son, this is an \"account buying\" scam! Look at the link — the domain differs from the official one by two letters. It's a counterfeit phishing site. The moment you enter your password, the account is stolen."

# game/ch07.rpy:71
translate english ch7_B1_7661945d:

    # n "爸爸陪阿狐举报了链接，还帮账号开启了更高级的安全验证。"
    n "Dad helped Ahu report the link and turned on stronger security verification for the account."

# game/ch07.rpy:74
translate english ch7_B1_16a41678:

    # police laugh "问家长问得好！游戏账号密码等于账号的「全部钥匙」，任何索要密码的「平台」「客服」，一律是骗子！"
    police laugh "Smart to ask! Your game password is the \"master key\" to the account. Any \"platform\" or \"support\" asking for it is a scammer!"

# game/ch07.rpy:86
translate english ch7_B2_9c6353c7:

    # mc serious "交易我只走官方平台，陌生链接我一律不点。你要真想收号，就到官方平台挂单。"
    mc serious "I only trade on the official platform and never click strange links. If you really want the account, list your offer there."

# game/ch07.rpy:87
translate english ch7_B2_ad31fab8:

    # fraud serious "官方平台手续费太高了！链接是内部通道，不点就别怪我没提醒你，高价名额马上没了！"
    fraud serious "Official platform fees are too high! The link is an internal channel — don't blame me if you miss out. High-price slots are almost gone!"

# game/ch07.rpy:88
translate english ch7_B2_97aaa55b:

    # think serious "真平台不怕走官方流程，怕的一定是骗子。"
    think serious "A real platform doesn't fear official procedures — whoever fears them is a scammer."

# game/ch07.rpy:89
translate english ch7_B2_d0baa9e9:

    # n "阿狐不再理会。当晚，群里另一名同学按同款链接填了账号密码，高级号连同所有皮肤瞬间被盗，追悔莫及。"
    n "Ahu ignored it. That evening, another kid in the group entered his account and password on the same link — his high-rank account and every skin stolen in seconds. Too late for regrets."

# game/ch07.rpy:92
translate english ch7_B2_79fbd141:

    # police serious "你的坚持救了自己！记住：所有「绕开官方」的私下交易链接，都是钓鱼网站。宁可少卖点钱，也绝不交出密码！"
    police serious "Your persistence saved you! Remember: every link that bypasses the official platform is a phishing site. Better to sell cheaper than hand over your password!"

# game/ch07.rpy:104
translate english ch7_B3_ddc30cbd:

    # n "阿狐点开链接，看着逼真的平台页面，填入了游戏账号和密码。"
    n "Ahu opened the link and, facing the realistic page, entered his game account and password."

# game/ch07.rpy:105
translate english ch7_B3_5342667a:

    # n "页面随即显示：账号已锁定，需缴纳50元「解冻保证金」完成评估，解冻后原路退回。"
    n "The page then showed: account locked — pay a 50-yuan \"unfreezing deposit\" to finish the appraisal, refundable afterward."

# game/ch07.rpy:106
translate english ch7_B3_9448959f:

    # fraud serious "快付保证金，不然账号会被平台冻结三天，影响信誉哦！"
    fraud serious "Pay the deposit quickly, or the platform freezes your account for three days and your reputation suffers!"

# game/ch07.rpy:107
translate english ch7_B3_e1da21f6:

    # think serious "等等！评估账号怎么还要交保证金？老师说过，这是「解冻金」骗局的套路！"
    think serious "Wait! An appraisal needs a deposit? Teacher said this is the \"unfreezing fee\" scam playbook!"

# game/ch07.rpy:108
translate english ch7_B3_3919bb9a:

    # mc serious "我不付了，你们是钓鱼平台！"
    mc serious "I'm not paying. You're a phishing platform!"

# game/ch07.rpy:109
translate english ch7_B3_95e072e3:

    # n "阿狐立刻退出页面，把事情告诉爸爸。爸爸马上修改了游戏密码、解绑了关联支付，账号保住了。"
    n "Ahu quit the page at once and told Dad, who immediately changed the game password and unlinked the payment method. The account was saved."

# game/ch07.rpy:112
translate english ch7_B3_1dee1b11:

    # police serious "好险！密码已经泄露，好在改得及时。「解冻金」「保证金」是收号骗局的第一刀，再往下就是连环收费。账号密码，永远不给陌生人！"
    police serious "Close call! The password leaked, but the quick change saved you. \"Unfreezing fees\" and \"deposits\" are the first cut of the account-buying scam — chain fees follow. Never give your password to strangers!"

# game/ch07.rpy:124
translate english ch7_C_5c528267:

    # n "阿狐一心想卖个好价钱，把账号密码填进了对方发来的「平台链接」。"
    n "Hoping for a good price, Ahu entered his account and password into the \"platform link\" the scammer sent."

# game/ch07.rpy:125
translate english ch7_C_16416023:

    # think laugh "高级号，怎么也得值个500块吧！"
    think laugh "A high-rank account has to be worth 500 at least!"

# game/ch07.rpy:126
translate english ch7_C_56f45a9a:

    # mc laugh "我的账号是高级号，皮肤很多，你快评估一下！"
    mc laugh "My account is high-rank with tons of skins — appraise it quickly!"

# game/ch07.rpy:127
translate english ch7_C_3e31cd11:

    # fraud laugh "评估完毕：你的账号价值520元！钱已打入平台账户，请登录「平台」提现。"
    fraud laugh "Appraisal done: your account is worth 520 yuan! The money is in your platform account — log in to withdraw."

# game/ch07.rpy:128
translate english ch7_C_6c9391d7:

    # n "阿狐登录链接页面，却弹出提示：账户异常冻结，需缴纳500元「解冻金」才能提现，否则将扣除1000元违约金。"
    n "Ahu logged in to the link page, but a notice popped up: account abnormally frozen — pay a 500-yuan \"unfreezing fee\" to withdraw, or a 1,000-yuan penalty applies."

# game/ch07.rpy:129
translate english ch7_C_10fc4697:

    # fraud serious "这是平台规定！不交解冻金，还要赔偿违约金，账号也会被没收！"
    fraud serious "It's platform policy! No unfreezing fee means a penalty charge — and your account will be confiscated!"

# game/ch07.rpy:143
translate english ch7_C1_0c663d50:

    # n "看着「再交500」的要求，阿狐心里突然咯噔一下。"
    n "Seeing the demand to \"pay another 500\", Ahu's heart suddenly skipped."

# game/ch07.rpy:144
translate english ch7_C1_0f1ce8f2:

    # think serious "不对！明明是我卖号收钱，怎么反而要我不停交钱？老师说过，「解冻金」「保证金」全是收号骗局的套路！"
    think serious "Wait! I'm the one selling and getting paid — why do I keep paying them? Teacher said \"unfreezing fees\" and \"deposits\" are the account-scam playbook!"

# game/ch07.rpy:145
translate english ch7_C1_57c85b2c:

    # mc serious "我不交！你们这是钓鱼平台，我要举报你，还要把链接交给警察叔叔！"
    mc serious "I'm not paying! This is a phishing platform — I'm reporting you and handing the link to the police!"

# game/ch07.rpy:146
translate english ch7_C1_23db5a27:

    # n "阿狐退出页面，把整件事告诉爸爸。爸爸马上修改游戏密码、开启登录保护，并向平台官方举报了钓鱼链接。"
    n "Ahu quit the page and told Dad everything. Dad immediately changed the game password, enabled login protection, and reported the phishing link to the official platform."

# game/ch07.rpy:147
translate english ch7_C1_ea8bb33f:

    # dad laugh "临「钱」不乱，还知道保留证据，儿子真棒！"
    dad laugh "Calm in front of money, and you kept the evidence — great job, son!"

# game/ch07.rpy:150
translate english ch7_C1_12b43e3e:

    # police serious "识破「卖号反被收钱」的把戏，反应很快！记住：凡是让你交钱才能「提现」「解冻」的，都是骗局，交得越多陷得越深！"
    police serious "Quick reflexes seeing through the \"seller pays\" trick! Remember: anyone demanding money to \"withdraw\" or \"unfreeze\" is running a scam — the more you pay, the deeper you sink!"

# game/ch07.rpy:162
translate english ch7_C2_d78d8d03:

    # n "阿狐舍不得「账户里」的520元，决定先交100元「小额解冻费」试试。"
    n "Reluctant to lose the 520 yuan \"in the account\", Ahu decided to pay a 100-yuan \"partial unfreezing fee\" first."

# game/ch07.rpy:163
translate english ch7_C2_0ffe68f4:

    # think laugh "先交100，账号解冻了，520元不就回来了？"
    think laugh "Pay 100 first — once it unfreezes, my 520 comes back, right?"

# game/ch07.rpy:165
translate english ch7_C2_9072b953:

    # mc confused "怎么解冻还有进度条？这钱到底还提不提得出来？"
    mc confused "Unfreezing has a progress bar? Will I ever get this money out?"

# game/ch07.rpy:166
translate english ch7_C2_eab50fcd:

    # n "阿狐把事情告诉爸爸。爸爸说这就是连环骗局，之前的钱都打了水漂，好在账号密码马上改掉，没被一锅端。"
    n "Ahu told Dad. He said it was a chain scam — the earlier money was gone, but luckily the password was changed right away, so the account itself was saved."

# game/ch07.rpy:169
translate english ch7_C2_20af978f:

    # police serious "骗子的「解冻进度」永远差最后一截！止损最好的时机，就是识破骗局的那一刻。多交的100元，买了个教训。"
    police serious "A scammer's \"unfreezing progress\" is always short of the end! The best time to cut losses is the moment you see through the scam. The extra 100 yuan bought a lesson."

# game/ch07.rpy:181
translate english ch7_C3_bdf27e65:

    # n "阿狐害怕赔1000元违约金，把攒的500元零花钱全部交了「解冻金」。"
    n "Terrified of the 1,000-yuan penalty, Ahu paid his entire 500-yuan savings as the \"unfreezing fee\"."

# game/ch07.rpy:182
translate english ch7_C3_a3bb5f64:

    # n "页面却再次弹出：检测到未成年人操作，需再交800元「实名认证金」，否则账户永久冻结、违约金翻倍。"
    n "The page flashed again: minor operation detected — pay an 800-yuan \"identity verification fee\" or the account freezes permanently and the penalty doubles."

# game/ch07.rpy:183
translate english ch7_C3_2fe2536f:

    # n "与此同时，阿狐发现自己的游戏账号已在别处登录——密码被骗子改了，高级号、皮肤、道具全部易主。"
    n "At the same moment, Ahu found his game account logged in elsewhere — the scammer had changed the password. The high-rank account, skins, and items all changed hands."

# game/ch07.rpy:184
translate english ch7_C3_9cad5a6e:

    # mc sad "号没了，钱也没了……我怎么办呀……"
    mc sad "The account is gone, the money is gone... What do I do now...?"

# game/ch07.rpy:185
translate english ch7_C3_144ff7bd:

    # n "阿狐哭着向爸爸坦白。爸爸第一时间联系游戏官方申诉冻结账号，并报了警。"
    n "Ahu confessed to Dad through tears. Dad immediately appealed to the game's official support to freeze the account and reported to the police."

# game/ch07.rpy:186
translate english ch7_C3_c53b9586:

    # dad normal "吃一堑长一智。账号和钱的事，以后一定先跟爸爸妈妈商量。"
    dad normal "A fall into the pit, a gain in your wit. From now on, anything about accounts or money gets discussed with Mom and Dad first."

# game/ch07.rpy:189
translate english ch7_C3_665e5d96:

    # police serious "小朋友记住！「高价收号」骗局两步走：钓鱼链接骗走账号，解冻金骗走存款。账号密码不外传，私下交易不参与，官方渠道才可靠！"
    police serious "Kids, remember! The \"high-price account buying\" scam has two steps: a phishing link steals the account, an unfreezing fee steals your savings. Never share passwords, never trade privately, stick to official channels!"

